      "id": "steel_push-debrief-dalia",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Vanguard was not simply looking for Fuel. These orders tie the seizure to Qassem's Relay access plan. We stopped the column, but their long-range battery is now targeting the forward base.",
