      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "steel_push-debrief-aria",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The recovered order names the final authority key, but its meaning is not yet confirmed. I will preserve the evidence. The next defense requires a verified battery target and enough forces to hold the base.",
